OL,4,CTwo walkers rescued after becoming     
OL,5,Cstranded in snow and strong winds      
OL,6,GTwo walkers were rescued after getting 
OL,7,Ginto difficulty in snow and strong     
OL,8,Gwinds in the Cairngorms.               
OL,10,FBraemar Mountain Rescue Team (MRT),    
OL,11,Fassisted by volunteers from Aberdeen   
OL,12,FMRT, were able to make contact with    
OL,13,Fthe tourists, who were stranded near   
OL,14,FLochnagar on Tuesday.                  
OL,16,FRescuers said they were able to work   
OL,17,Fout their general location after some  
OL,18,Finitial difficulty, partly due to a    
OL,19,Flanguage barrier.                      
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
