OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,.-,.,,.-.-,.,/,-./,-,./
OL,4,CCouncil unable to confirm when storm-  
OL,5,Chit leisure centre will reopen         
OL,6,GCouncil bosses have yet to confirm     
OL,7,Gwhen Helensburgh Leisure Centre will   
OL,8,Greopen, almost two years after it was  
OL,9,Gclosed in the wake of damage sustained 
OL,10,Gduring Storm Eowyn.                    
OL,12,FThe seaside town's community council   
OL,13,Fexpressed concern at the pace of       
OL,14,Fprogress, despite the fact a recent    
OL,15,Fworks update confirmed that the roof   
OL,16,Frepairs had been completed.            
OL,18,FThe facility has been closed since     
OL,19,Fparts of its roof were ripped off in   
OL,20,FJanuary last year.                     
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
