OL,4,CSouthern white rhino calf born at      
OL,5,CBlair Drummond Safari Park             
OL,6,GA southern white rhino calf has been   
OL,7,Gborn at Blair Drummond Safari Park     
OL,8,Gnear Stirling.                         
OL,10,FThe female calf is the seventh to be   
OL,11,Fborn to mother Dot and father Graham,  
OL,12,Fwho are both aged 26.                  
OL,14,FAfter a 16-month pregnancy, Dot gave   
OL,15,Fbirth to a calf weighing around 99lbs  
OL,16,F(45kg) at 14:25 on 19 November.        
OL,18,FSouthern white rhinos are classed as   
OL,19,F"near threatened" on the International 
OL,20,FUnion for Conservation of Nature       
OL,21,F(IUCN) red list of endangered species. 
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
